{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53207","headline":"诗偈 三十二 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 三十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此个一羣贼，生生欺主人。\n即今识汝也，不共汝相亲。\n你若不伏我，我则处处说。\n教人总识汝，遣汝行路绝。\n你若能伏我，我亦不分别。\n共汝同一身，永离於生灭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53207.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53207","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}